# Ignore everything by default, then white-list the files that really belong to
# the project. This keeps screenshots, scratch scripts, editor swap files and
# local notes out of the repository.
*
!.gitignore

# --- project files -----------------------------------------------------------
!ds991.html
!index.html
!Readme.md
!LICENSE
!sync.sh

# --- development / test tools ------------------------------------------------
# `*` also matches the tools directory itself, so the directory and its contents
# each have to be re-included: a file inside an excluded directory cannot be
# brought back by a pattern inside it.
!tools/
!tools/*

# --- keep ignoring the usual junk --------------------------------------------
# (these come after the white-list so they win)
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
